<Doc title="Setting Up Prompts | Athenum Docs">
  <h1>Setting Up Prompts</h1>
  <p>Build a useful prompt set with direct entry or the Discover tab. Group prompts into topics for aggregate reporting; attach personas and locations.</p>
  <h2>Schedules</h2>
  <p>The default schedule samples every active prompt daily. Custom schedules increase frequency for high-stakes prompts; archived schedules keep their history.</p>
</Doc>
